ToricTopology -- homological computations in toric topology
***********************************************************

Description
===========

ToricTopology is a package for computing with quasitoric manifolds, small
covers and moment-angle complexes.

A quasitoric manifold (or small cover) is entirely determined by a pair
consisting of a simplicial complex K and a matrix lambda which is
characteristic for K.

If K has n vertices, we can think of its k-faces as sets of integers between 1
and n. A matrix lambda is characteristic for K if all maximal minors of lambda
indexed by the facets of  K have determinant equal to 1 or -1.

