QuasiToricManifold -- the class of all quasitoric manifolds
***********************************************************

Description
===========

A quasitoric manifold is represented by a simplicial complex K and matrix which
is characteristic for K.

See also
========

  * *note SmallCover: SmallCover, -- the class of all small covers

Functions and methods returning a quasitoric manifold:
======================================================

  * *note complexProjectiveSpace: complexProjectiveSpace, -- complex projective
    space of dimension n
  * "complexProjectiveSpace(ZZ)" -- see *note complexProjectiveSpace:
    complexProjectiveSpace, -- complex projective space of dimension n
  * *note quasiToricManifold: quasiToricManifold, -- create a quasitoric
    manifold

Methods that use a quasitoric manifold:
=======================================

  * "bettiQTM(QuasiToricManifold)" -- see *note bettiQTM: bettiQTM, -- compute
    the Betti numbers of a quasitoric manifold
  * "bettiQTM(ZZ,QuasiToricManifold)" -- see *note bettiQTM: bettiQTM, --
    compute the Betti numbers of a quasitoric manifold
  * "chern(QuasiToricManifold)" -- see *note chern: chern, -- compute the Chern
    classes of a quasitoric manifold
  * "cohomologyRing(QuasiToricManifold)" -- see *note cohomologyRing:
    cohomologyRing, -- compute the cohomology ring of a small cover or
    quasitoric manifold

