smallCover -- create a small cover
**********************************

  * Usage: 
        smallCover(K,lambda)
  * Inputs:
      * K, an *note abstract simplicial complex:
        (SimplicialComplexes)SimplicialComplex,,
      * lambda, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note small cover: SmallCover,, 

Description
===========

Create a small cover over K with characteristic matrix lambda.  If lambda is
not characteristic for K, then an error is returned.  The entries of lambda are
automatically converted to ZZ/2 entries, if they not already so.

The following example illustrates creating the 2-torus as a small cover over
the unit square.

+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : needsPackage "SimplicialComplexes"                                   |
|                                                                          |
|o1 = SimplicialComplexes                                                  |
|                                                                          |
|o1 : Package                                                              |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : R = QQ[a..d]                                                         |
|                                                                          |
|o2 = R                                                                    |
|                                                                          |
|o2 : PolynomialRing                                                       |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : K = simplicialComplex {a*b, b*c, c*d, d*a}                           |
|                                                                          |
|o3 = simplicialComplex | cd ad bc ab |                                    |
|                                                                          |
|o3 : SimplicialComplex                                                    |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : lambda = matrix{{1, 0, 1, 0}, {0, 1, 0, 1}}                          |
|                                                                          |
|o4 = | 1 0 1 0 |                                                          |
|     | 0 1 0 1 |                                                          |
|                                                                          |
|              2       4                                                   |
|o4 : Matrix ZZ  <-- ZZ                                                    |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : X = smallCover(K, lambda)                                            |
|                                                                          |
|o5 = SmallCover{QTMCharacteristicMatrix => | 1 0 1 0 |                   }|
|                                           | 0 1 0 1 |                    |
|                QTMDimension => 2                                         |
|                QTMSimplicialComplex => simplicialComplex | cd ad bc ab | |
|                                                                          |
|o5 : SmallCover                                                           |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+

For the programmer
==================

The object *note smallCover: smallCover, is a *note method function:
(Macaulay2Doc)MethodFunction,.

